</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4c560a8933fc9a1dEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9260762bee1e8fdbEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_GlitterbeardNinefingersLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_GlitterbeardNinefingersLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_GlitterbeardNinefingersLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7369de10-e4bb-40db-b772-f8bfca981751</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7369de10-e4bb-40db-b772-f8bfca981751\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7369de10-e4bb-40db-b772-f8bfca981751\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_of_Books\" title=\"Stack of Books\">Stack of Books</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#The_Counting_House_-_High_Security_Vaults\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House High Security Vaults</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-717&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;874</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Glitterbeard,\n</p><p>This feels like the right time to tell you that I'm well aware of the accounting regularities in your most recent <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">Guild</a> tithes. But don't worry - you have a chance to make up for it. Get this right, and you'll have the honour of being the one Guild outfit to survive a raid by the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a>.\n</p><p>Get it wrong, then you had best make sure he kills you.\n</p><p><br>\nNF\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714235751\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30802/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argu